       "nuestro casa",
       "nuestra casa",
       "casa 阴性"
      ],
      [
       "tú perro",
       "tu perro",
       "你的 = tu，无重音符号"
      ]
     ],
     "sum": "<b>物主形容词看后面的名词</b>：mis libros，nuestra casa。",
